# Supabase client configuration — public values only.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the values from your own Supabase
# project (Project Settings → API). `.env.local` is gitignored and must never be
# committed.
#
# Only these two variables belong in the browser. The anon/publishable key is
# designed to be public; authorization is enforced by Row Level Security.
#
# NEVER add the service-role key (or a `sb_secret_...` key) to any VITE_
# variable. Vite inlines VITE_ values into the shipped bundle, which would hand
# every visitor full database access.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
